{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41875","headline":"秋夜吟寄左偃 · 李中","name":"秋夜吟寄左偃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君诗兴素来狂，况入清秋夜景长。\n溪阁共谁看好月，莎堦应独听寒螿。\n卷中新句诚堪喜，身外浮名不足忙。\n会约垂名继前哲，任他玄发尽如霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}